{"739790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Beauty Cult's NECTARMANCER", "steam_appid": 739790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nectarmancer is a Gardenvania action-platformer where you grow living weapons, engineer plant genetics, and explore a vast interconnected world powered by a mysterious substance called Nectar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced acrobatic combat, cultivate powerful plant species, and explore a vast interconnected world where every discovery can unlock new ways to fight, survive, and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STORY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Congratulations on your duty, Nectarmancer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the realm's most trusted collector, collect bounties to expand THE THRONE's eternal dominion.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THE THRONE governs. THE THRONE protects. THE THRONE provides.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world runs on Nectar, a mysterious substance that changes the world around it.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Aisa, a prisoner forced into the Collection Corps, an expendable Nectarmancer sent beyond the walls to harvest the life-sustaining substance that powers the realm. But outside THE THRONE's domain, the truth is taking root. Spirits rage. Ecosystems collapse. Forbidden experiments twist nature into weapons. And the deeper Aisa ventures, the clearer it becomes: the world is not dying by accident.  <br><strong>Will you continue feeding the machine consuming the world, or use its own tools to bring it down?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/410d7cc8cae2f3098b069a4388020e95.avif?t=1787009857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras_big/410d7cc8cae2f3098b069a4388020e95.webp?t=1787009857 width=1560 height=301 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GROW LIVING WEAPONS. Plants are your weapons and tools. Discover rare species, preserve genetic traits, and breed powerful new hybrids. Every expedition expands your arsenal with new ways to fight, explore, and survive. Unlock new movement abilities, combat options, and hidden paths through illicit research, genetic traits, and Nectar-fueled upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/22ea06302152f057d49870824ae16b73.poster.avif?t=1787009857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/22ea06302152f057d49870824ae16b73.webm?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/22ea06302152f057d49870824ae16b73.mp4?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/f8ba2799f1ec7a01df196bdc75b1acdc.avif?t=1787009857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras_big/f8ba2799f1ec7a01df196bdc75b1acdc.webp?t=1787009857 width=1560 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, vault, strike, and chain abilities together in fluid, high-skill combat. Master movement, timing, and plant synergy to overcome aggressive enemies, dynamic encounters, and challenging boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/1eba4c15546062c387d11158f3bb5522.poster.avif?t=1787009857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/1eba4c15546062c387d11158f3bb5522.webm?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/1eba4c15546062c387d11158f3bb5522.mp4?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/01bd81ee6123a9dafc0f708a162eab63.avif?t=1787009857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras_big/01bd81ee6123a9dafc0f708a162eab63.webp?t=1787009857 width=1560 height=301 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wilds are beautiful, hostile, and unforgiving. Death means losing the seeds, fruits, and plants you carry. Every journey is a calculated risk. Every successful return matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/4c82fa6d47e1db623e2a967d53583935.poster.avif?t=1787009857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/4c82fa6d47e1db623e2a967d53583935.webm?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/4c82fa6d47e1db623e2a967d53583935.mp4?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/fcbade7e2ec9c18ac6c2b2de58316a96.avif?t=1787009857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras_big/fcbade7e2ec9c18ac6c2b2de58316a96.webp?t=1787009857 width=1560 height=301 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your research through a living biological computer that powers your progression. Unlock Nectar abilities, socketable upgrades, skill-tree enhancements, and new ways to customize your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/fa76bf2276b89ce8054c9205fa9b412d.poster.avif?t=1787009857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/fa76bf2276b89ce8054c9205fa9b412d.webm?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/fa76bf2276b89ce8054c9205fa9b412d.mp4?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And More...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging boss fights that demand mastery of movement and plant combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic enemies that target your plants and punish passive strategies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Thousands of genetic combinations, every trait a double-edged sword</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Ultrabit 2.5d pixel-art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Original fantasy soundtrack crafted from boutique analog synthesizers, real instruments, drums and choirs</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nectarmancer is a Gardenvania action-platformer where you grow living weapons, engineer plant genetics, and explore a vast interconnected world powered by a mysterious substance called Nectar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master fast-paced acrobatic combat, cultivate powerful plant species, and explore a vast interconnected world where every discovery can unlock new ways to fight, survive, and progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>STORY</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Congratulations on your duty, Nectarmancer.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>As the realm's most trusted collector, collect bounties to expand THE THRONE's eternal dominion.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>THE THRONE governs. THE THRONE protects. THE THRONE provides.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world runs on Nectar, a mysterious substance that changes the world around it.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Aisa, a prisoner forced into the Collection Corps, an expendable Nectarmancer sent beyond the walls to harvest the life-sustaining substance that powers the realm. But outside THE THRONE's domain, the truth is taking root. Spirits rage. Ecosystems collapse. Forbidden experiments twist nature into weapons. And the deeper Aisa ventures, the clearer it becomes: the world is not dying by accident.  <br><strong>Will you continue feeding the machine consuming the world, or use its own tools to bring it down?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/410d7cc8cae2f3098b069a4388020e95.avif?t=1787009857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras_big/410d7cc8cae2f3098b069a4388020e95.webp?t=1787009857 width=1560 height=301 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GROW LIVING WEAPONS. Plants are your weapons and tools. Discover rare species, preserve genetic traits, and breed powerful new hybrids. Every expedition expands your arsenal with new ways to fight, explore, and survive. Unlock new movement abilities, combat options, and hidden paths through illicit research, genetic traits, and Nectar-fueled upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/22ea06302152f057d49870824ae16b73.poster.avif?t=1787009857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/22ea06302152f057d49870824ae16b73.webm?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/22ea06302152f057d49870824ae16b73.mp4?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/f8ba2799f1ec7a01df196bdc75b1acdc.avif?t=1787009857\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras_big/f8ba2799f1ec7a01df196bdc75b1acdc.webp?t=1787009857 width=1560 height=301 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash, vault, strike, and chain abilities together in fluid, high-skill combat. Master movement, timing, and plant synergy to overcome aggressive enemies, dynamic encounters, and challenging boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/1eba4c15546062c387d11158f3bb5522.poster.avif?t=1787009857\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/1eba4c15546062c387d11158f3bb5522.webm?t=1787009857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/739790/extras/1eba4c15546062c387d11158f3bb5522.mp4?t=1787009857\" typ